WHOA THERE!  Advanced File System, or AdvFS != Transarc's AFS.  AdvFS is a
log-based file system that provides higher reliability(and no more fsck!)
and faster recovery on reboot.  the utilities, which are layered, also provide
some extended capabilities.  check out the SPD (gatekeeper.dec.com in sub-dir
