 The POLYCENTER Advanced File System Utilities product extends system
 availability by providing access to online data during routine main-
 tenance. By using a technique called "cloning," the software creates
 a read-only snapshot of the fileset while the system is on line. The
 clone is then backed up while users and applications are accessing the
 data in the original fileset. Also, users can recover the most recently
 deleted file immediately, rather than waiting for a restore from off-
 line backup media.

