>One other option that should be considered is the OEM DEC DLT (Linear Tape)
>DLT2000 with a capacity of 20Gb with compaction and compression and a sustained>data rate of 2.5Mbytes/sec. This uses the same 0.5 inch form factor cartridges
>as the TK50/TK70. I have seen a price of $4000 for the 20Gbyte version. DEC also
>offer the TZ85 (2.6 Gbyte version) and the TZ86 (6 Gbyte version). 
