Pixie is provided as part of the OSF/1 distribution for the Alpha.  It may be
that you have not installed the setld subset that contains pixie.

On my Alpha versions of pixie are in the following subsets.

C89BASEA120	( for DEC C or c89)
CXXBASEA120	( for DEC C++ )
OSFCMPLRS120	( for the base system cc )
OSFCMPLRS121	( upgrade to cc )

and the man page is in 

OSFMANOS120

This is on DEC OSF/1 V1.2 Worksystem Software (Rev. 10)


