Another interesting thing is that Ultrix nowadys seems to cache the disk
in 64k chunks, i.e. maxcontig=8. This is set during installation. But if
a new disk is added with the default newfs params, maxcontig=1. This will
give a very low sequential read/write performance.....

Soo....
