>*BUT*, within MrmFetchWidget, during fetching the XmMainWidget, the
>application
>dies with a BadMatch Error in a "X_CreateWindow"!

In one of the more obscure features of the X Window System (tm),
you also need to set the border pixel or pixmap. The default is a
border pixmap of CopyFromParent; if the parent has a different depth
(24-bit vs 8-bit, in this case) then its pixmap will not match your
window and you get a BadMatch. This applies even if border width is zero.

Everybody gets caught by this one the first time, most people get caught
two or three times :-).

