One thing to check is you have to have the memory modules in the
right slots.  For 16MB it should be in:

      --------- back of box --------
      [empty ]
      [empty ]
      [memory]
      [memory]
      [memory]
      [memory]
      [empty ]
      [empty ]
      [memory]
      [memory]
      [memory]
      [memory]
      --------- front of box -------

Plus make sure they are all seated correctly (not always easy).
And of course, you might have static-zapped some of them messing
about in there...   :-(

