I've had an ST225 in a VS2000 that does a similar thing... no spinup.  Then,
of course, I get some goofy error in the self-test on powerup.  The solution is
to gently but firmly jar the cabinet on one corner forcing the whole cabinet
to quickly rotate about 3".  Evidently, the drive spindle bearings are a little
stiff & this knocks it loose & it spins up.  If you ever get it to spin up,
get your important data OFF of it!
