Newsgroups: comp.os.vms
Subject: Poor Man's X Terminal
Message-ID: <1993Jun22.174403.22442@Princeton.EDU>
Date: 22 Jun 93 17:44:03 GMT
Sender: news@Princeton.EDU (USENET News System)
Reply-To: groth@pupgg.princeton.edu
