	HPII HPIII
	HPIIsi
	HP 4
	HP Deskjet
	Canon Laser (CaPSL)
	Canon Bubble Jet
	Espon 9 Pin
	Espon 24 Pin
	IBM 9 Pin
	IBM 24 Pin

It will print faxes at 150x150 or 300x300.

It supports 3 paper sizes Letter, Legal, A4.

It supports paper source selection.

It supports various phone options including ring count and Voice/FAX switching 
so that you can use the line as a voice line.

It allows for 1-9 copies to made of each FAX.

All options are set through a friendly touch tone interface i.e. you call the 
unit and set the options.

The connectors on the box are...

	Line (RJ)
	Phone (RJ)

	Parallel from computer (Centronics)
	Serial from computer (DB-25)
	
	Parallel to printer (DB-25)
	Serial to printer (DB-9)

Serial ports are Xon/Xoff, DTR flow control with "robust" Xon flow control as 
an option.

I have my DEC computer, my PC, and my phone line all attached to my HP1200C 
via this box.

